### Problem Description

Synthetic source produced via fallback mechanism is not correct when using `subobjects: false` and using object arrays.

### Steps to Reproduce

```
PUT /my_index
{
  "mappings": {
    "_source": { "mode": "synthetic" },
    "subobjects": false,
    "properties": {
      "obj": {
        "properties": {
          "k": {
              "type": "keyword",
              "doc_values": false
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```

```
PUT my_index/_doc/1
{
  "obj": [{"k": "key1"}, {"k": "key2"}]
}
```

```
GET /my_index/_doc/1

// Produces
"_source": {
    "obj.k": "key2"
}
```



